Ngeneric:Invisible-Pin|pin@10||-30|44|||||SIM_spice_card(D5G1;)S["* ===== SRAM_tb4: write 4 bits at different places (0x13=1, 0xA7=0, 0xFF=1, 0x68=0), read them back =====","* Test: write 13=1, write A7=0, write FF=1, write 68=0, read FF, read 13, read 68, read A7.  (A = 8-bit serial address, MSB first; 9 clock cycles per access)","* TSMC 0.18um BSIM3, TYPICAL corner (TT), VDD 1.8 V, 27 C.  Pass/fail is printed in the SPICE log:  RDk_xx = DOUT voltage, PASSk_xx = 1 if read k (address xx) is correct.","* Models: in Electric set  Preferences > Tools > Simulation (SPICE) > Spice Header Card Info = tsmc018.lib  (model file, as for the V1 test cells).","* Electric lambda must be 90 nm (library setting), so a 2-lambda gate is written L=0.18U.  Delete these 2 comment lines if you prefer an explicit .include.",.param VDD=1.8,.param TCLK=5n,.param TR=0.1n,.param TSTART=150n,.param T0={ceil(TSTART/TCLK)*TCLK},.param CLOAD=5p,.param TSTEP=50p,.param NTAIL=10          ; idle clock cycles kept running after the last read,.param TSTOP={T0+(9*8+3+NTAIL)*TCLK},.temp 27,.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=7,.model DIO D(IS=1e-14 CJO=0.2p),Vdd vdd 0 PWL(0 0 10n {VDD}),VCLK_s CLK_s 0 PULSE(0 {VDD} {T0+0.5*TCLK} {TR} {TR} {0.5*TCLK-TR} {TCLK}),VRW_s RW_s 0 PWL(0 0 {T0+8*TCLK+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+8*TCLK+TR+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+9*TCLK+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+9*TCLK+TR+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+17*TCLK+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+17*TCLK+TR+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+18*TCLK+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+18*TCLK+TR+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+26*TCLK+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+26*TCLK+TR+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+27*TCLK+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+27*TCLK+TR+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+35*TCLK+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+35*TCLK+TR+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+36*TCLK+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+36*TCLK+TR+TR} {0*VDD}),VADDR_s ADDR_s 0 PWL(0 0 {T0+3*TCLK+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+3*TCLK+TR+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+4*TCLK+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+4*TCLK+TR+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+6*TCLK+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+6*TCLK+TR+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+8*TCLK+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+8*TCLK+TR+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+9*TCLK+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+9*TCLK+TR+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+10*TCLK+TR} {1*VDD} {T0+10*TCLK+TR+TR} {0*VDD} {T0+11*TCLK+TR}